# <Component Design Spec>

<Punchline: Design tokens, layout anatomy, interactive state behaviors, and WCAG AA accessibility requirements for the standard design system Button component.>

> [!NOTE]
> **Component Status**: Production Ready (`@org/ui-components@^3.2.0`).
> Figma Component Library: [Figma Design Tokens & Anatomy](https://figma.com/@org/design-system)

---

## Visual Anatomy

```
 ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
 │ 1 [Icon Left]   2 [Button Label Text]   3 [Icon Right] │
 └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

1. **Leading Icon (Optional)**: 16x16 SVG glyph, aligned with text baseline.
2. **Label Container**: Text node with uppercase or sentence case styling; ellipsis truncation on overflow.
3. **Trailing Icon (Optional)**: Used for dropdown carets or external link indicators.

---

## Design Tokens & Spacing

| Token Property | Design Token Name | Value | Description |
|---|---|---|---|
| **Height** | `--btn-height-md` | `40px` | Standard medium touch target |
| **Padding (X)** | `--btn-padding-x` | `16px` (1rem) | Horizontal inner gutter |
| **Border Radius** | `--btn-radius` | `6px` | Match platform card corner radius |
| **Font Family** | `--font-sans` | `Inter, -apple-system` | Primary UI sans-serif |
| **Font Size / Weight** | `--btn-font-size` | `14px / 600` | High-scannability semibold weight |

